          "id": "turn-1",
          "text": "Thank you, Satya, Satya, and good afternoon everyone. Our results exceeded expectations across revenue, operating income and earnings per share. Driven by strong demand across the Microsoft Cloud. This This quarter, revenue was $92.3 billion up 19% gross margin dollars increased 17% and gross margin percentage was 68% operating operating income increased 21% and 22% in constant currency earnings per share was $4.89 and increase of 18% and 19% in constant currency when adjusted for the impact for our investment in OpenAI.",
